ckbox\"\n                  disabled\n                />\n                <span class=\"checkbox-toggle\"></span>\n                Strikt noodzakelijk\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                   \n          <div class=\"coi-banner-consent-field\">\n            <div\n              class=\"coi-consent-banner__switch-container\"\n              id=\"switch-cookie_cat_functional\"\n            >\n              <label for=\"cookie_cat_functional\" class=\"coi-checkboxes\">\n                <input\n                  class=\"coi__checkbox\"\n                  tabindex=\"0\"\n                  data-index=\"0\"\n                  name=\"cookie_cat_functional\"\n                  id=\"cookie_cat_functional\"\n                  data-testid=\"coi-banner__checkbox--cookie_cat_functional-cookies\"\n                  type=\"checkbox\"\n                  onclick=\"CookieInformation.changeCategoryConsentDecision('cookie_cat_functional')\"\n                />\n                <span class=\"checkbox-toggle\"></span>\n                Functioneel\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                  \n          <div class=\"coi-banner-consent-field\">\n            <div\n              class=\"coi-consent-banner__switch-container\"\n              id=\"switch-cookie_cat_statistic\"\n            >\n              <label for=\"cookie_cat_statistic\" class=\"coi-checkboxes\">\n                <input\n                  class=\"coi__checkbox\"\n                  tabindex=\"0\"\n                  data-index=\"0\"\n                  name=\"cookie_cat_statistic\"\n                  id=\"cookie_cat_statistic\"\n                  data-testid=\"coi-banner__checkbox--cookie_cat_statistic-cookies\"\n                  type=\"checkbox\"\n                  onclick=\"CookieInformation.changeCategoryConsentDecision('cookie_cat_statistic')\"\n                />\n                <span class=\"checkbox-toggle\"></span>\n                Statistisch\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                  \n          <div class=\"coi-banner-consent-field\">\n            <div\n              class=\"coi-consent-banner__switch-container\"\n              id=\"switch-cookie_cat_marketing\"\n            >\n              <label for=\"cookie_cat_marketing\" class=\"coi-checkboxes\">\n                <input\n                  class=\"coi__checkbox\"\n                  tabindex=\"0\"\n                  data-index=\"0\"\n                  name=\"cookie_cat_marketing\"\n                  id=\"cookie_cat_marketing\"\n                  data-testid=\"coi-banner__checkbox--cookie_cat_marketing-cookies\"\n                  type=\"checkbox\"\n                  onclick=\"CookieInformation.changeCategoryConsentDecision('cookie_cat_marketing')\"\n                />\n                <span class=\"checkbox-toggle\"></span>\n                Publiciteit\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n                \n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"coi-banner__branding-wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\" data-testid=\"coi-banner__branding-wrapper\">\n        <span class=\"coi-banner__branding\" lang=\"en\">\n          \n        </span\n        >\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"coiPage-3\" class=\"coi-banner__page\" style=\"display: none;\">\n      <div class=\"coi-banner__cookiedeclaration\">\n        <div class=\"coi-banner__header\"></div>\n        <div class=\"coi-banner__text\">\n          <h2 class=\"coi-banner__headline\">\n            Cookiebeleid\n          </h2>\n          <div class=\"coi-banner__maintext\">\n            <strong class=\"top-column__bold-text\">\n              Uw toestemming is van toepassing op de volgende domeinen:\n            </strong>\n            <span class=\"top-column__website-domains\">\n              profile.brusselsairport.be, bruvoucher.brusselsairport.be, altitude.brusselsairport.be, buymyloungepass.brusselsairport.be, happyholidays.brusselsairport.be, connected.brusselsairport.be, marokko.brusselsairport.be, lab.brusselsairport.be, memory.brusselsairport.be, enjoy.brusselsairport.be, timeforholiday.brusselsairport.be, brusselsairport.be, packmaster.brusselsairport.be, contest.brusselsairport.be, checkout.brusselsairport.be, risingfog.brusselsairport.be, fastlane.brusselsairport.be, captainbruce.brusselsairport.be, getfastlane.brusselsairport.be, brucard.brusselsairport.be, summer.brusselsairport.be, getlounge.brusselsairport.be, turkiye.brusselsairport.be, jobs.brusselsairport.be\n            </span>\n            <strong class=\"top-column__bold-text\">Het cookiebeleid is voor het laatst bijgewerkt op 07.10.2026</strong>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cookiedeclaration_wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"bottom-column__why-cookies\">\n          \n<h2>Wat is een cookie?</h2>\n<p>Een cookie is een klein gegevensbestand dat wordt opgeslagen op uw computer, tablet of smartphone. Een cookie is geen programma dat schadelijke malware of virussen kan bevatten.</p>\n<h2>Hoe de website cookies gebruikt</h2>\n<p>Sommige cookies voeren essentiële functies voor de website uit. Cookies helpen ons ook begrijpen waarom u de website bezoekt, zodat we de website continu kunnen optimaliseren en kunnen toespitsen op uw specifieke behoeften en interesses. Cookies bewaren dingen zoals de artikelen die aan een winkelwagentje zijn toegevoegd, of u de website in het verleden hebt bezocht, of u bent ingelogd en de specifieke taal en valuta die u op de website wilt zien. We gebruiken ook cookies om onze advertenties specifiek aan u aan te passen op andere websites. In het algemeen gebruiken we cookies als onderdeel van onze service om u content te aan te bieden die zo relevant mogelijk voor u is.</p>\n<p>U kunt de specifieke services zien die cookies opslaan en waarom onder de verschillende categorieën:</p>\n<ol class=\"coi-purpose-list\"></ol>\n<h2>Hoelang worden cookies opgeslagen?</h2>\n<p>Het varieert hoelang een cookie op uw apparaten en browsers wordt opgeslagen. De levensduur van een cookie wordt berekend op basis van uw laatste bezoek aan de website. Wanneer de levensduur van een cookie wordt bereikt, wordt deze automatisch verwijderd. De levensduur van al onze cookies wordt gespecificeerd in ons cookiebeleid.</p>\n<h2>Cookies afwijzen of verwijderen</h2>\n<p>U kunt alle cookies en/of cookies van derden altijd volledig afwijzen door de instellingen van uw browser te veranderen op uw computer, tablet of smartphone. Waar u deze instellingen kunt vinden, is afhankelijk van de browser die u gebruikt. U dient er alleen rekening mee te houden dat als u alle cookies en/of cookies van derden afwijst, er functies en services op de website zijn die u niet meer kunt gebruiken (omdat deze van cookies afhankelijk zijn).<br>\n    <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout\" target=\"_blank\">U kunt cookies van Google Analytics hier deselecteren<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a>.\n</p>\n<h2>Hoe kunnen cookies worden verwijderd?</h2>\n<p>Het is gemakkelijk om cookies te verwijderen die u eerder hebt geaccepteerd. De procedure voor het verwijderen is afhankelijk van de browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, enz.) en het apparaat dat u gebruikt (smartphone, tablet, pc, Mac). <br /> Deze functie is doorgaans te vinden onder instellingen – Beveiliging en privacy – maar dit kan per browser variëren.  Geef aan welk apparaat/welke browser u gebruikt (klik op de toepasselijke link):</p>\n<ul>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\">Google Chrome<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a></li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT201265\" target=\"_blank\">Safari<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a></li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/help/4027947/microsoft-edge-delete-cookies\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Edge<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a></li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/delete-cookies-remove-info-websites-stored\" target=\"_blank\">Mozilla Firefox<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a></li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://www.samsung.com/uk/support/mobile-devices/using-the-samsung-internet-app/\" target=\"_blank\">Samsung Internet<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a></li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://help.opera.com/en/latest/web-preferences/#cookies\" target=\"_blank\">Opera<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a></li>\n    <li><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://timeread.hubpages.com/hub/How-to-delete-internet-cookies-on-your-Droid-or-any-Android-device\" target=\"_blank\">Android<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Uw toestemming veranderen</h2>\n<p>Klik op de onderstaande link om uw toestemming te veranderen ofwel door cookies te verwijderen van uw browser, ofwel door uw oorspronkelijke keuze te veranderen:</p>\n<button class=\"coi-banner__privacy-policy-return\" onClick=\"javascript:TogglePage(this, 'coiPage-1');\"><svg width='24' height='24' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><path d='M19 12H5M5 12L12 19M5 12L12 5' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'/></svg>Wijzig je toestemmingsinstellingen</button>\n<a class=\"coi-renew-link\" href=\"javascript:CookieConsent.renew();\">Wijzig je toestemmingsinstellingen</a>\n<p>Let op: Als u meer dan één browser gebruikt, moet u in alle browsers de cookies verwijderen.</p>\n<h2>Hebt u nog vragen?</h2>\n<p>Als u opmerkingen of vragen hebt met betrekking tot onze informatie en/of het verwerken van persoonsgegevens, kunt u altijd contact met ons opnemen.\n    Het cookiebeleid zelf wordt één keer per maand bijgewerkt door <a href=\"https://cookieinformation.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cookie Information<svg class=\"coi-external-link__icon\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M18 12.9285V18.5C18 18.9925 17.7893 19.4648 17.4142 19.8132C17.0391 20.1615 16.5304 20.3571 16 20.3571H4.99999C4.46958 20.3571 3.96087 20.1615 3.58578 19.8132C3.21072 19.4648 3 18.9925 3 18.5V8.28567C3 7.79314 3.21072 7.32077 3.58578 6.97248C3.96087 6.6242 4.46958 6.42854 4.99999 6.42854H11M15 3.64282H21M21 3.64282V9.21425M21 3.64282L10 13.8571\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span></a>. Indien u vragen heeft over ons cookiebeleid, kunt u contact opnemen met Cookie Information via hun website.</p>\n<style>#coiPage-3 a.coi-renew-link {display: none;} .coi-banner__privacy-policy-return {display: block;} #coitable .coi-renew-link {display: block;} #coitable .coi-banner__privacy-policy-return {display: none;}</style>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div\n        class=\"coi-banner__page-footer\"\n        role=\"navigation\"\n        aria-label=\"third-menu\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"coi-button-group\">\n          <button\n            tabindex=\"0\"\n            onclick=\"TogglePage(this, 'coiPage-1')\"\n            class=\"coi-banner__lastpage\"\n            data-testid=\"coi-banner__settings-button\"\n          >\n            Instellingen\n          </button>\n          <button\n            tabindex=\"0\"\n            onclick=\"CookieInformation.submitAllCategories();\"\n            class=\"coi-banner__accept\"\n            data-testid=\"coi-banner__accept-all-categories-button\"\n          >\n            Alles accepteren\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"coi-banner__branding-wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\">\n        <span class=\"coi-banner__branding\" lang=\"en\">\n          Powered by:\n          <a\n            class=\"coi-external-link\"\n            href=\"https://cookieinformation.com/\"\n            target=\"_blank\"\n            data-testid=\"coi-banner__company-website-link\"\n          >\n            Cookie Information\n            <span class=\"screen-reader-only\">opent in nieuw tabblad</span>\n          </a>\n        </span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>";
  var js = "/**\n    Template name: Overlay v2 - Google Consent Mode v2\n    URI: https://cookieinformation.com\n    Version 1.2.1\n **/\n\nconst coiOverlay = document.getElementById(\"coiOverlay\");\nconst coiBannerWrapper = document.getElementById(\"coi-banner-wrapper\");\nconst coiRenewBtn = document.getElementById(\"Coi-Renew\");\nconst coiPurposesList = document.getElementsByClassName(\"coi-purpose-list\");\n\n/* LOGO FUNCTION START */\n(function () {\n    const imagePath = \"\"; // Change this to your own logo URL\n    const container = document.getElementsByClassName(\"coi-banner__branding-wrapper\");\n\n    if (imagePath) {\n        for (const el of Array.from(container)) {\n            const logo = document.createElement(\"img\");\n            logo.style.width = \"180px\"; // Change width for better fit\n            logo.src = imagePath;\n            logo.alt = \"logo\";\n            el.insertBefore(logo, el.childNodes[0]);\n        }\n    } else {\n        for (const el of Array.from(container)) {\n            const logo = document.createElement(\"span\");\n            logo.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"true\");\n            el.insertBefore(logo, el.childNodes[0]);\n        }\n    }\n})();\n/* LOGO FUNCTION END */\n\nfunction insertPurposesInList() {\n    if (coiPurposesList) {\n        const purposesElements =\n            document.getElementById(\"coi-banner-categories\")?.innerHTML ?? \"\";\n        for (const list of Array.from(coiPurposesList)) {\n            list.innerHTML = purposesElements;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfunction trapFocusInModal(modal) {\n    modal = document.getElementById(modal);\n    const focusableEl = modal.querySelectorAll(\n        'button:not([disabled]), a[href]:not([disabled]), input:not([disabled]), select, textarea:not([disabled]), [tabindex]:not([tabindex=\"-1\"])'\n    );\n    const firstFocusableEl = focusableEl[0];\n    const lastFocusableEl = focusableEl[focusableEl.length - 1];\n    const KEYCODE_TAB = 9;\n    coiBannerWrapper.focus();\n\n    const ctlFocus = (e) => {\n        const isTabPressed = e.key === \"Tab\" || e.keyCode === KEYCODE_TAB;\n        if (!isTabPressed) {\n            return;\n        }\n        if (e.shiftKey) {\n            /* shift + tab */ if (document.activeElement === firstFocusableEl) {\n                lastFocusableEl.focus();\n                e.preventDefault();\n            }\n        } else {\n            /* tab */ if (document.activeElement === lastFocusableEl) {\n                firstFocusableEl.focus();\n                e.preventDefault();\n            }\n        }\n        document.activeElement.scrollIntoView();\n    };\n\n    modal.addEventListener(\"keydown\", ctlFocus);\n}\n\nfunction checkConsentsState() {\n    const checkedElements = document.querySelectorAll(\n        \".coi__checkbox:not(#cookie_cat_necessary):checked\"\n    );\n    setConsentOption(checkedElements.length > 0);\n}\n\nconst checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll(\n    \".coi__checkbox:not(#cookie_cat_necessary)\"\n);\n\nfor (const checkbox of Array.from(checkboxes)) {\n    checkbox.addEventListener(\"change\", () => {\n        checkConsentsState();\n    });\n}\n\nfunction setConsentOption(state) {\n    const updateButton = document.getElementById(\"updateButton\");\n    const declineButton = document.getElementById(\"declineButton\");\n\n    if (state) {\n        declineButton.style.display = \"none\";\n        declineButton.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", -1);\n        updateButton.style.display = \"flex\";\n        updateButton.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", 0);\n    } else {\n        updateButton.style.display = \"none\";\n        updateButton.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", -1);\n        declineButton.style.display = \"flex\";\n        declineButton.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", 0);\n    }\n}\n\nfunction TogglePage(triggerEl, targetId) {\n    const pages = document.getElementsByClassName(\"coi-banner__page\");\n    const links = document.getElementsByClassName(\"coi-banner__lastpage\");\n    const target = document.getElementById(targetId);\n\n    if (!target) return;\n\n    for (const page of Array.from(pages)) {\n        page.style.display = \"none\";\n    }\n\n    for (const link of Array.from(links)) {\n        link.classList.remove(\"activeTab\");\n    }\n\n    target.style.display = \"block\";\n    triggerEl.classList.add(\"activeTab\");\n    trapFocusInModal(targetId);\n}\n\nfunction toggleDetails() {\n    const toggleBtn = document.getElementById(\"coi-details-toggle\");\n    const categoryWrapper = document.getElementById(\"coiConsentBannerCategoriesWrapper\");\n\n    if (!toggleBtn || !categoryWrapper) return;\n\n    const isExpanded = toggleBtn.getAttribute(\"aria-expanded\") === \"true\";\n    toggleBtn.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", !isExpanded);\n\n    const showText = toggleBtn.querySelector(\".coi-toggle-show-details\");\n    const hideText = toggleBtn.querySelector(\".coi-toggle-hide-details\");\n\n    if (showText) showText.style.display = isExpanded ? \"inline\" : \"none\";\n    if (hideText) hideText.style.display = isExpanded ? \"none\" : \"inline\";\n\n    categoryWrapper.style.display = isExpanded ? \"none\" : \"block\";\n    categoryWrapper.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", isExpanded);\n\n    const categories = document.querySelectorAll(\".coi-consent-banner__category-name\");\n    for (const category of Array.from(categories)) {\n        category.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", isExpanded ? -1 : 0);\n\n        if (isExpanded) {\n            category.classList.remove(\"ci-btn-tab-active\");\n            category.setAttribute(\"aria-expanded\", \"false\");\n        }\n    }\n\n    if (isExpanded) {\n        const categoryTabs = document.querySelectorAll(\".coi-consent-banner__description-container\");\n        for (const categoryTab of Array.from(categoryTabs)) {\n            categoryTab.classList.remove(\"tab-panel-active\");\n            categoryTab.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"true\");\n\n            const links = categoryTab.querySelectorAll(\"a\");\n            for (const link of Array.from(links)) {\n                link.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", -1);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfunction toggleCookieDetails(btn, tab) {\n    const tabContent = document.getElementById(tab);\n    btn.classList.toggle(\"ci-btn-tab-active\");\n    btn.setAttribute(\n        \"aria-expanded\",\n        btn.getAttribute(\"aria-expanded\") === \"false\" ? \"true\" : \"false\"\n    );\n\n    tabContent.classList.toggle(\"tab-panel-active\");\n    tabContent.setAttribute(\n        \"aria-hidden\",\n        tabContent.getAttribute(\"aria-hidden\") === \"false\" ? \"true\" : \"false\"\n    );\n\n    const links = tabContent.querySelectorAll(\"a\");\n    const tabIndexValue = tabContent.classList.contains(\"tab-panel-active\") ? 0 : -1;\n    for (const link of Array.from(links)) {\n        link.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", tabIndexValue);\n    }\n}\n\ncoiOverlay.addEventListener(\n    \"click\",\n    (e) => {\n        if (e.target === e.currentTarget) {\n            e.preventDefault();\n            coiBannerWrapper.classList.remove(\"ci-bounce\");\n            coiBannerWrapper.offsetWidth;\n            coiBannerWrapper.classList.add(\"ci-bounce\");\n        }\n    },\n    false\n);\n\nfunction togglePlaceholderElementsOnConsent() {\n    const consentPlaceholders = document.getElementsByClassName(\n        \"consent-placeholder\"\n    );\n    if (consentPlaceholders) {\n        for (const placeholder of Array.from(consentPlaceholders)) {\n            const dataCategory = placeholder.getAttribute(\"data-category\");\n            if (!CookieInformation.getConsentGivenFor(dataCategory)) {\n                placeholder.style.display = \"block\";\n            } else {\n                placeholder.style.display = \"none\";\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nfunction setNoScroll(state) {\n    const htmlElement = document.getElementsByTagName(\"html\")[0];\n    if (state) {\n        htmlElement.classList.add(\"noScroll\");\n    } else {\n        htmlElement.classList.remove(\"noScroll\");\n    }\n}\n\nfunction showCookieBanner() {\n    insertPurposesInList();\n    coiOverlay.style.display = \"flex\";\n    setNoScroll(true);\n    coiBannerWrapper.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"false\");\n    coiOverlay.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"false\");\n    requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n        trapFocusInModal(\"coiPage-1\");\n    });\n    checkConsentsState();\n\n    coiRenewBtn.style.display = \"none\";\n    togglePlaceholderElementsOnConsent();\n}\n\nfunction hideCookieBanner() {\n    if (coiOverlay.contains(document.activeElement)) {\n        document.activeElement.blur();\n    }\n\n    if (coiRenewBtn && coiRenewBtn.offsetParent !== null) {\n        coiRenewBtn.focus();\n    } else {\n        document.body.setAttribute(\"tabindex\", \"-1\");\n        document.body.focus();\n        document.body.removeAttribute(\"tabindex\");\n    }\n\n    coiBannerWrapper.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"true\");\n    coiOverlay.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"true\");\n    coiOverlay.style.display = \"none\";\n    setNoScroll(false);\n\n    coiRenewBtn.style.display = \"block\";\n    togglePlaceholderElementsOnConsent();\n}";
  var showBannerMethod = "showCookieBanner";
  var hideBannerMethod = "hideCookieBanner";
  var showDetailsText = "Details weergeven";
  var hideDetailsText = "Details verbergen";
  var website = "brusselsairport.be";
  var domains = "profile.brusselsairport.be, bruvoucher.brusselsairport.be, altitude.brusselsairport.be, buymyloungepass.brusselsairport.be, happyholidays.brusselsairport.be, connected.brusselsairport.be, marokko.brusselsairport.be, lab.brusselsairport.be, memory.brusselsairport.be, enjoy.brusselsairport.be, timeforholiday.brusselsairport.be, brusselsairport.be, packmaster.brusselsairport.be, contest.brusselsairport.be, checkout.brusselsairport.be, risingfog.brusselsairport.be, fastlane.brusselsairport.be, captainbruce.brusselsairport.be, getfastlane.brusselsairport.be, brucard.brusselsairport.be, summer.brusselsairport.be, getlounge.brusselsairport.be, turkiye.brusselsairport.be, jobs.brusselsairport.be";
  var categories = "cookie_cat_necessary,cookie_cat_functional,cookie_cat_statistic,cookie_cat_marketing,cookie_cat_unclassified";
  var consentVersionId = "6a6da448-7b53-4f0f-a490-bf54870fd086";
  var websiteId = "Ql1JqyPQok";
  var consentSharing = true;
  var automaticInstallationParams = null;
  CookieInformation.initializeBanner(
    template,
    js,
    showBannerMethod,
    hideBannerMethod,
    showDetailsText,
    hideDetailsText,
    website,
    domains,
    categories,
    consentVersionId,
    websiteId,
    consentSharing,
    automaticInstallationParams
  );
})();
